# SQLite databases + journal/WAL sidecars — per-unit runtime data, never synced
data/*.db
data/*.db-*

# Per-robot session log — local only, not synced across fleet
.claude/resume_chat.md

# Runtime state (night_mode.json etc.) — per-unit, not synced
state/
data/media/

# OTA versioned layout (2026-08-31): per-unit data lives in
# /home/morgan/wimz/shared/ and appears in the release dir as SYMLINKS.
# Dir patterns like `data/` don't match symlinks, so ignore the names
# explicitly (root-anchored). VOICEMP3 itself stays a real dir (wimz/ is
# tracked); its talks/ and songs/ symlinks are covered by VOICEMP3/*.
/data
/env_new
/logs
/state
/captures
/photos
/recordings
